        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Table Reservation\n---\nsequenceDiagram\n  actor Customer\n  participant App as Mobile App\n  participant API as Reservation API\n  participant DB as Database\n  participant Restaurant\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Search restaurants\n  App-&gt;&gt;API: getRestaurants()\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Fetch restaurant details\n  DB--&gt;&gt;API: Restaurant list\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Display restaurants\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Select restaurant and date\n  App-&gt;&gt;API: checkTableAvailability(details)\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Find available tables\n  DB--&gt;&gt;API: Available tables\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Display available tables\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Select table and guest count\n  App-&gt;&gt;API: createReservation(details)\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save reservation\n\n  alt Table is available\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Reservation saved\n    API-&gt;&gt;Restaurant: Send reservation notification\n    API--&gt;&gt;App: Reservation confirmed\n    App--&gt;&gt;Customer: Display confirmation\n  else Table unavailable\n    API--&gt;&gt;App: Reservation unavailable\n    App--&gt;&gt;Customer: Select another table\n  end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="2">
